      "title": "ScrollAction",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ScrollScreenAction": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Scroll inside one open window so more of its contents become visible.\n\nShops and inventories hold more than fits on screen, and the export only\never describes what is currently rendered. Without this, stock past the\nfirst screenful is not merely hard to reach - it does not exist as far as\nthe agent is concerned, and no amount of replanning reveals it.\n\nNames a window rather than a coordinate: the scroll lands at the centre of\nthat window's own observed bounds, so it follows the window and survives a\nresolution change.",
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "const": "scroll_screen",
          "default": "scroll_screen",
          "title": "Kind",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "window": {
          "maxLength": 200,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Window",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "notches": {
          "maximum": 8,
          "minimum": -8,
          "title": "Notches",
          "type": "integer"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "window",
        "notches"
      ],
      "title": "ScrollScreenAction",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "SellItemAction": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Sell the item in one exact cell of the agent's own inventory.\n\nThe mirror of `purchase_item`, and the reason trading stopped being one-way:\nwith only a purchase action the agent could spend its starting money and\nthen never earn any.\n\nDeliberately carries no expected price. A shop pays its own multiplier on an\nitem's value rather than the listed value, and that offer is not exported,\nso asserting a price here would be asserting something we cannot check - the\nexact failure mode `purchase_item` was built to avoid. What *is* checked is\nthat the cell is in this character's own inventory and holds this item.",
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "const": "sell_item",
          "default": "sell_item",
          "title": "Kind",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "cell_label": {
          "maxLength": 80,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Cell Label",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "item_name": {
          "maxLength": 200,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Item Name",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "window": {
          "maxLength": 200,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Window",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "buyer_id": {
          "maxLength": 200,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Buyer Id",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "cell_label",
        "item_name",
        "window",
        "buyer_id"
      ],
      "title": "SellItemAction",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "SemanticActionReceipt": {
